description: Schema and message file rules
globs: src/main/resources/**
alwaysApply: false
---

Change the H2, MySQL, and Postgres schema files and data files together.
H2 and MySQL `data.sql` insert visits by position, so add the new value to every visits row.
Add every new message key to all `messages*.properties` files. A test checks that these files stay in sync.
